# The tool that writes the CycloneDX SBOM. It has its own lock so the main development environment
# stays small, and it is only installed by the SBOM job. Same rules as the other lock files: exact
# pins, hashes, wheels only, and every version at least 14 days old (scripts/check_lock.py checks it).
